{"id":177,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","X","HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"Because its wings aren’t yet fully grown, it has to hop to get around. It is always staring at something."},{"games":["Sword","Crystal"],"text":"It is extremely good at climbing tree trunks and likes to eat the new sprouts on the trees."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"The look in its eyes gives the impression that it’s carefully observing you. If you approach it, Natu will hop away."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Although it still can’t fly, its jumping power is outstanding. It jumps way up into trees and plucks the buds from the branches."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Natu has a highly developed jumping ability. The Pokémon flaps and leaps onto tree branches that are taller than grown-up people to pick at the tree’s new shoots."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Natu cannot fly because its wings are not yet fully grown. If your eyes meet with this Pokémon’s eyes, it will stare back intently at you. But if you move even slightly, it will hop away to safety."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"It usually forages for food on the ground but may, on rare occasions, hop onto branches to peck at shoots."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It picks food from cactus plants, deftly avoiding buds and spines. It seems to skip about to move."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It runs up short trees that grow on the savanna to peck at new shoots. A NATU’s eyes look as if they are always observing something."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Synchronize","hidden":false,"description":"If the Pokémon is burned, paralyzed, or poisoned by another Pokémon, that Pokémon will be inflicted with the same status condition."},{"name":"Early Bird","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon awakens from sleep twice as fast as other Pokémon."},{"name":"Magic Bounce","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon reflects status moves instead of getting hit by them."}],"eggGroups":["Flying"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"forest","color":"Green","shape":"Wings","evolution":{"id":177,"name":"Natu","condition":null,"children":[{"id":178,"name":"Xatu","condition":"Lv. 25","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,43],[1,64],[5,500],[10,100],[15,109],[20,101],[26,375],[30,384],[35,94],[35,385],[40,273],[45,248]],"machine":[403,502,213,226,347,322,605,203,263,248,202,447,385,257,286,113,478,384,182,94,473,240,115,156,496,247,285,214,173,76,211,500,164,241,129,168,86,271,433,369,428],"egg":[65,297,98,355,493,389],"tutor":[814,797]},"cards":[{"id":"sv4pt5-25","name":"Natu","set":"Paldean Fates","date":"2024-01-26","rarity":"Common","number":"25","artist":"Teeziro","img":"sv4pt5/25"},{"id":"sv4pt5-151","name":"Natu","set":"Paldean Fates","date":"2024-01-26","rarity":"Shiny Rare","number":"151","artist":"sowsow","img":"sv4pt5/151"},{"id":"sv4-71","name":"Natu","set":"Paradox Rift","date":"2023-11-03","rarity":"Common","number":"71","artist":"ryoma uratsuka","img":"sv4/71"},{"id":"pgo-32","name":"Natu","set":"Pokémon GO","date":"2022-07-01","rarity":"Common","number":"32","artist":"HYOGONOSUKE","img":"pgo/32"},{"id":"swsh2-76","name":"Natu","set":"Rebel Clash","date":"2020-05-01","rarity":"Common","number":"76","artist":"Naoyo Kimura","img":"swsh2/76"},{"id":"sm12-78","name":"Natu","set":"Cosmic Eclipse","date":"2019-11-01","rarity":"Common","number":"78","artist":"tetsuya koizumi","img":"sm12/78"},{"id":"sm8-87","name":"Natu","set":"Lost Thunder","date":"2018-11-02","rarity":"Common","number":"87","artist":"Anesaki Dynamic","img":"sm8/87"},{"id":"xy6-27","name":"Natu","set":"Roaring Skies","date":"2015-05-06","rarity":"Common","number":"27","artist":"Atsuko Nishida","img":"xy6/27"},{"id":"xy6-28","name":"Natu","set":"Roaring Skies","date":"2015-05-06","rarity":"Common","number":"28","artist":"Kagemaru Himeno","img":"xy6/28"},{"id":